<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Matsushita Electric 6-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Matsushita Electric 6-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 28.79	 vs	  26.52</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	89.0	  vs	  82.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  407.53	 vs	 375.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   41.13	 vs	  37.88</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	 10.0	  vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Matsushita Electric Co (M) Bhd. It makes and sells electrical consumer products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
